# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored: Dockerfile runs `npm ci`, which
# fails hard without it, so ignoring it made `docker compose build` impossible
# from a clean clone. Committing it also pins the frontend, whose Docker stage
# would otherwise resolve fresh transitive versions on every build.

